OL,3,ASaudi capital airport hit again,
OL,4,Asparking evacuations, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international airport in the Saudi
OL,7,Fcapital has been attacked again,
OL,8,Freports say, just days after Yemen's
OL,9,FHouthi rebels claimed two successful
OL,10,Fattacks on the hub.
OL,12,FKing Khalid International Airport in
OL,13,FRiyadh was evacuated after a loud blast
OL,14,Fwas heard on Saturday, two
OL,15,Finternational news agencies have
OL,16,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
