OL,3,ASaudi capital airport hit again,
OL,4,Asparking evacuations, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen ambulances were seen
OL,7,Frushing to the airport, according to
OL,8,FReuters, citing an eyewitness. Saudi
OL,9,Fauthorities have not commented, while
OL,10,Fthe airport told passengers to check
OL,11,Fwith their airline before travelling
OL,12,Fthere.
OL,14,FThe attack comes a day after
OL,15,Fauthorities said three Saudi nationals,
OL,16,Fincluding a pilot, were killed in two
OL,17,Fattacks by the Iran-backed Houthis the
OL,18,Fday prior.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
